            "reviewBody": "When you are in a pinch for a veggie side dish, this is pretty classic and versatile. While I prefer fresh broccoli- sometimes you are simply without and this can hold its own as a stand-in. Only change was that I added (like others) was some minced garlic when I added the red pepper flakes. I predict this would work with fresh but may need to cover the pan to get it to cook quickly yet without burning. Thank you R T = J/C/S!",
